{"id":"xwy59frzblm535fuwegmtkent","title":"上海前10个月外贸进出口增长18.7%","originalTitle":"前10个月上海外贸进出口增长18.7%","summary":"今年前10个月，上海市货物贸易进出口总值达4.41万亿元，同比增长18.7%。其中，出口增长23.4%，进口增长15%。高技术产品出口显著提速，集成电路出口增长23%。外商投资企业和民营企业是主要外贸主体，分别占全市进出口的52%和32.3%。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15349715.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T10:29:46.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T10:53:52.989Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T10:53:52.989Z","category":"macro","tags":["数据发布"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"bffcb7ea-ee4f-43c9-9225-881dc6e24f16","title":"上海前10个月货物贸易进出口增长18.7%"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(孙晶智)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"bffcb7ea-ee4f-43c9-9225-881dc6e24f16","title":"上海前10个月货物贸易进出口增长18.7%"}],"topics":[{"slug":"data","name":"数据发布"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fZARRt02-qdQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}